# INVWINEJ.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:ALLP.CFG, a settings file that is not there, on the assemblies of
# TEST/KEYS/PANEA.REQ: every row chosen in the lists that have a pane
# and in the panes.  On the assemblies CTRL-/ chooses all three, the
# parts beside them still the focus row's, item 1's; END keeps them
# chosen and the parts follow the focus row, item 7; HOME brings item
# 1's back.  F6 and CTRL-/ choose both parts, the assemblies still shown
# chosen, and Take out takes both out: the assemblies, fetched again,
# have item 1 no more and one row chosen, and take the focus.  On the
# categories CTRL-/ chooses nothing, their list taking one row; F6 and
# CTRL-/ choose the three items of the first, SYS, and CTRL-L lends all
# three; the items of CARD, three rows down, then have one row chosen.
# On the loans and holds CTRL-/ chooses the three loans, END keeps them
# and the history is the focus row's item's, and Return or release ends
# all three, which leaves the history empty.  On the users, in CLERK's
# audit entries beside them, CTRL-/ chooses nothing, that list too
# taking one row.  Every date is typed, so that no snapshot holds the
# day of the run.  The end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINEJ.SNP is its
# snapshot; TEST/selchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-I A CTRL-SLASH
S MALL
K END
S MEND
K HOME
S MHOME
K F6 CTRL-SLASH
S PALL
K ALT-C T
T A1
K ENTER
S POUT
K ALT-I T CTRL-SLASH
S CATS
K F6 CTRL-SLASH
S CALL
K CTRL-L TAB
T Carol King
K TAB TAB
T 2026-10-01
K TAB
T 2026-11-01
K ENTER
S CLENT
K ESC DOWN DOWN DOWN
S CNEXT
K ALT-I O CTRL-SLASH END
S LALL
K ALT-C R
T 2026-10-03
K ENTER
S LRET
K ALT-A U DOWN
S USERS
K F6 CTRL-SLASH
S UAUD
K ALT-F X
